# S61: e1m7, the camera craning back from the lava pit as Chthon rises ("id Software
# released Quake's source"). Chthon is woken the game's own way, by its `use` with the
# player as the activator, as taking the rune does: `fire t4 at 1.9`. The player waits
# behind the entrance corridor's end wall, out of the line of fire, so no damage flash
# tints the picture. Slop, no status bar.

map e1m7

duration 9
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud off
player -600,64,56,0
cvar gamma 0.8

fire t4 at 1.9

camera path
key 1.0  -100,64,200  15,0  ease inout
key 8.0  -170,64,270  20,0

sound on
events on
